      "parameters": {
        "content": "INSTAGRAM ACCOUNT DAILY METRICS\n\n1. Replace Pipeline Config placeholders.\n2. Use a long-lived Meta access token with Instagram Graph API permissions.\n3. Use the Instagram Business Account ID, not the ad account ID.\n4. Run manually first, confirm social_accounts and social_account_daily_metrics upsert successfully, then activate.",
